            "is_free": true,
            "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/636560/extras/3affef62daf6b46315c617725b53b7ea.avif?t=1791831883\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/636560/extras_big/3affef62daf6b46315c617725b53b7ea.avif?t=1791831883 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runewards is a free-to-play fantasy strategy card game of bluffs, timing and clever deckbuilding.</strong> Play the story campaign, test your decks against the AI, or climb the ranked leagues against players on PC and Android.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/636560/extras/e19b977c9a72214bedb3755099a6ded5.avif?t=1791831883\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/636560/extras_big/e19b977c9a72214bedb3755099a6ded5.avif?t=1791831883 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every unit you put on the Battlefield has <strong>Power</strong>. When a round ends, the side with the higher Total Power wins it, and the first to win <strong>two rounds</strong> takes the match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The real game is in the choices. Every card has an ability that can strengthen your line, weaken your opponent's or turn the whole board around. Do you <strong>Pass</strong> early and save your best cards for the next round, or put everything on the table now?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/636560/extras/d61ee1521e5cea7ffbf7229d4f3c0a5b.avif?t=1791831883\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/636560/extras_big/d61ee1521e5cea7ffbf7229d4f3c0a5b.avif?t=1791831883 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Humans, Nature and Monsters</strong> each bring their own Heroes, units, spells and style of play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mercenaries</strong> fight for anyone and fit into every deck.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine abilities, chain them together, and build the deck that fits the way you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/636560/extras/e38fb37aed90c887ebc5f053959ba451.avif?t=1791831883\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/636560/extras_big/e38fb37aed90c887ebc5f053959ba451.avif?t=1791831883 width=1560 height=878 /></span><br>Try a new deck against the AI first. Five difficulty levels take you from <strong>Easy</strong> to <strong>Insane</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/636560/extras/ac99dfe7088b1bf973b418bcf48b469c.avif?t=1791831883\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/636560/extras_big/ac99dfe7088b1bf973b418bcf48b469c.avif?t=1791831883 width=1560 height=878 /></span><br>Climb the ranked leagues all the way to the top: <strong>Archon</strong>. Add friends, see who's online, chat, and challenge them to a friendly match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/636560/extras/f973bce00ab3741e1f7bab93d32fe8f9.avif?t=1791831883\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/636560/extras_big/f973bce00ab3741e1f7bab93d32fe8f9.avif?t=1791831883 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect cards and build decks for every faction. <strong>Craft</strong> the cards you're missing and <strong>salvage</strong> the ones you don't need.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/636560/extras/764c4c83019109e0853b4150c3d8d9e4.avif?t=1791831883\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/636560/extras_big/764c4c83019109e0853b4150c3d8d9e4.avif?t=1791831883 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn new cards just by playing. Daily quests and achievements reward you with <strong>Gold</strong>, and Gold opens chests full of new cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/636560/extras/fecbcc274f5d7cdfd8d7a8cb617054de.avif?t=1791831883\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/636560/extras_big/fecbcc274f5d7cdfd8d7a8cb617054de.avif?t=1791831883 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>",
            "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/636560/extras/3affef62daf6b46315c617725b53b7ea.avif?t=1791831883\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/636560/extras_big/3affef62daf6b46315c617725b53b7ea.avif?t=1791831883 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Runewards is a free-to-play fantasy strategy card game of bluffs, timing and clever deckbuilding.</strong> Play the story campaign, test your decks against the AI, or climb the ranked leagues against players on PC and Android.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/636560/extras/e19b977c9a72214bedb3755099a6ded5.avif?t=1791831883\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/636560/extras_big/e19b977c9a72214bedb3755099a6ded5.avif?t=1791831883 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every unit you put on the Battlefield has <strong>Power</strong>. When a round ends, the side with the higher Total Power wins it, and the first to win <strong>two rounds</strong> takes the match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The real game is in the choices. Every card has an ability that can strengthen your line, weaken your opponent's or turn the whole board around. Do you <strong>Pass</strong> early and save your best cards for the next round, or put everything on the table now?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/636560/extras/d61ee1521e5cea7ffbf7229d4f3c0a5b.avif?t=1791831883\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/636560/extras_big/d61ee1521e5cea7ffbf7229d4f3c0a5b.avif?t=1791831883 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Humans, Nature and Monsters</strong> each bring their own Heroes, units, spells and style of play.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mercenaries</strong> fight for anyone and fit into every deck.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine abilities, chain them together, and build the deck that fits the way you play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/636560/extras/e38fb37aed90c887ebc5f053959ba451.avif?t=1791831883\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/636560/extras_big/e38fb37aed90c887ebc5f053959ba451.avif?t=1791831883 width=1560 height=878 /></span><br>Try a new deck against the AI first. Five difficulty levels take you from <strong>Easy</strong> to <strong>Insane</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/636560/extras/ac99dfe7088b1bf973b418bcf48b469c.avif?t=1791831883\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/636560/extras_big/ac99dfe7088b1bf973b418bcf48b469c.avif?t=1791831883 width=1560 height=878 /></span><br>Climb the ranked leagues all the way to the top: <strong>Archon</strong>. Add friends, see who's online, chat, and challenge them to a friendly match.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/636560/extras/f973bce00ab3741e1f7bab93d32fe8f9.avif?t=1791831883\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/636560/extras_big/f973bce00ab3741e1f7bab93d32fe8f9.avif?t=1791831883 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect cards and build decks for every faction. <strong>Craft</strong> the cards you're missing and <strong>salvage</strong> the ones you don't need.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/636560/extras/764c4c83019109e0853b4150c3d8d9e4.avif?t=1791831883\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/636560/extras_big/764c4c83019109e0853b4150c3d8d9e4.avif?t=1791831883 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn new cards just by playing. Daily quests and achievements reward you with <strong>Gold</strong>, and Gold opens chests full of new cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/636560/extras/fecbcc274f5d7cdfd8d7a8cb617054de.avif?t=1791831883\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/636560/extras_big/fecbcc274f5d7cdfd8d7a8cb617054de.avif?t=1791831883 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>",
